description = "Lives on 8th Street with a clear view down Vine. Sees the ambulance and unmarked unit pull up outside Margaret Hayes's house and immediately calls the operator to relay it to Sheriff Briggs. Knows the town like the back of her hand but rarely raises her voice — she watches more than she speaks."
